github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70"}]},{"sha":"7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKDdiODk1OTc3YmZjMDZkMmRhMTBkOTE5MmQ4NzYzNjU0OTY3ZDNjNzA","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-21T12:21:45Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T12:21:45Z"},"message":"deps(core-worker): update uvicorn[standard] requirement from <1,>=0.34 to >=0.51.0,<1 in /core-worker (#603)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[uvicorn[standard]](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn) to permit the\nlatest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Version 0.51.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime\nreloads by <a href=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025\">Kludex/uvicorn#3025</a></li>\n<li>Remove colorama from the standard extra by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027\">Kludex/uvicorn#3027</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0\">https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/blob/main/docs/release-notes.md\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>0.51.0 (July 8, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers one at a time on <code>SIGHUP</code>, bringing each\nreplacement up before retiring the old worker, so reloads no longer drop\nrequests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Removed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>colorama</code> from the <code>standard</code> extra\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.2 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require <code>websockets&gt;=13.0</code>, which the default\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation needs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.1 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Split comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in\nthe <code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3019\">#3019</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.0 (July 4, 2026)</h2>\n<p>If you use WebSockets, note that <code>--ws auto</code> now picks the\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation. You shouldn't need it,\nbut you can pin <code>--ws websockets</code> to get the deprecated\nlegacy one back.</p>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Exit with the dedicated code 3 on any startup failure: app loading,\nsocket bind and lifespan startup errors previously exited with a mix of\n0, 1 and 3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Stop the multiprocess supervisor when a worker exits with code 3\ninstead of restarting it forever (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Default <code>--ws auto</code> to <code>websockets-sansio</code>\nwhen websockets is installed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n<li>Skip the eager app import in the parent process with\n<code>--reload</code> or <code>--workers</code>, fixing a memory\nregression introduced in 0.47.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3012\">#3012</a>)</li>\n<li>Build a fresh <code>asgi</code> scope dict per request (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2977\">#2977</a>)</li>\n<li>Cache the <code>asgi</code> scope sub-dict per connection (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2976\">#2976</a>)</li>\n<li>Avoid copying single-frame WebSocket payloads in\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2983\">#2983</a>)</li>\n<li>Memoize trusted host checks in <code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2970\">#2970</a>)</li>\n<li>Replace <code>click.style</code> with an internal ANSI style helper\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2981\">#2981</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Deprecated</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Deprecate the legacy <code>websockets</code> implementation; use\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> or <code>wsproto</code> instead (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.49.0 (June 3, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump <code>httptools</code> minimum version to 0.8.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2962\">#2962</a>)</li>\n<li>Consume duplicate forwarding headers in\n<code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code> (reverses the 0.48.0 behavior of\nignoring them) (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2971\">#2971</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.48.0 (May 24, 2026)</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/e4d0b05eb8c6459b7ba27ad13a2c2f4f8d4ece50\"><code>e4d0b05</code></a>\nVersion 0.51.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3028\">#3028</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/944e43ddbf715aea7c587f2738cd94c3f9106110\"><code>944e43d</code></a>\nRemove colorama from the standard extra (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2e787704f2610133059e76d56bbd60f48edd34a3\"><code>2e78770</code></a>\nRestart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime reloads\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/a1b570cf577d512bfd396b64d72313233e9c3325\"><code>a1b570c</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3022\">#3022</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/83c7da7332ac3100171c258071de40d5dde35e13\"><code>83c7da7</code></a>\nRequire websockets&gt;=13.0 for the default sansio implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/b4d011668a75d02370353f34de6dea59692dcad2\"><code>b4d0116</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3020\">#3020</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2a9151d0e763df2c56da2bfe8c5dcead4fe5a276\"><code>2a9151d</code></a>\nSplit comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in the\nwebsockets-sansi...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/1bf3ab42e3aba1cf4acd1ef0c29d8ad9a599d333\"><code>1bf3ab4</code></a>\nCover the excluded-directory branch in <code>FileFilter</code> with a\ndirect test (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3014\">#3014</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/837b5f960dbe2f03e9f12feb9955ce2217211ad8\"><code>837b5f9</code></a>\nDeflake multiprocess, reload, and signal supervisor tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2975\">#2975</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/21d2c16fd162ce0e92b5c35f4aadca63a8b12e2d\"><code>21d2c16</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3013\">#3013</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.34.0...0.51.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1ece5e33834215ce41e0441d84aab9fc87da08d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/1ece5e33834215ce41e0441d84aab9fc87da08d9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX2RZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAABykQAGJ+XKMFTivU/XQ5ulcAEITL\nns3q9te5jtMaNAXs+9n1FChRc5OLfakA42e6vQD1dxzT9I5IbP4IuXcDzRVx3gG/\nmf+xy9H30Gn8QamcwnAQmP8rkINoH8WrXXW/7OhhnMSTdYU2T7/BZdWcIMJaIQ3T\n1Hj/FQ6BGBLCyxbg5+XNUjFdwm82puU4lY9i2EsvJafAFIbcniqf1yPKBClqtBP6\nO5jfcb84c3RPHZZc7wr8RDaMs/YmOVg3vSegaGLSM5KKJMd01T7GpycW0rg+rWXh\ncNJly9hXh6S5s5Tmv7N/oEkOvD0mCQMVUltptckwL+SuoLYEcKv1dnUYbnA8wjoy\nqRtQynalJMiIcIfuM8Nj8kcFSE8No8CzEMi2CoMc2nhvYupkTnZ8rLD76FEzXuV4\n8Luc+B23BasZBTfXA2cIoDEH46Hq1KMATQCX4LfyWRDg190POW9dKitNlbx2haG7\nvcCwSFoAuWVstsUKlNBnCrmhokonhMkmG7Q35FuSNnIBmtZ+6+guUtoDgSumxcb2\nuOszJtn6BFz4YdbO3D9VuOjurG8ObQfMu9UuRwH9kiIX6qgKwFpnd4DHSlj+rM6B\nLkjmrJpxlzYgWf1GPMBYvwhCNooQi2ILfeWonCHSg68/fcKiHrqSMssX2mmy+oml\nMSFjGS6FbI4RAqaLLcDr\n=MxKs\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 1ece5e33834215ce41e0441d84aab9fc87da08d9\nparent c6a35d0a4c7ee09eb491108779e975a156b183e3\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1784636505 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784636505 +0300\n\ndeps(core-worker): update uvicorn[standard] requirement from <1,>=0.34 to >=0.51.0,<1 in /core-worker (#603)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[uvicorn[standard]](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn) to permit the\nlatest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Version 0.51.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime\nreloads by <a href=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025\">Kludex/uvicorn#3025</a></li>\n<li>Remove colorama from the standard extra by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027\">Kludex/uvicorn#3027</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0\">https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/blob/main/docs/release-notes.md\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>0.51.0 (July 8, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers one at a time on <code>SIGHUP</code>, bringing each\nreplacement up before retiring the old worker, so reloads no longer drop\nrequests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Removed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>colorama</code> from the <code>standard</code> extra\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.2 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require <code>websockets&gt;=13.0</code>, which the default\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation needs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.1 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Split comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in\nthe <code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3019\">#3019</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.0 (July 4, 2026)</h2>\n<p>If you use WebSockets, note that <code>--ws auto</code> now picks the\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation. You shouldn't need it,\nbut you can pin <code>--ws websockets</code> to get the deprecated\nlegacy one back.</p>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Exit with the dedicated code 3 on any startup failure: app loading,\nsocket bind and lifespan startup errors previously exited with a mix of\n0, 1 and 3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Stop the multiprocess supervisor when a worker exits with code 3\ninstead of restarting it forever (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Default <code>--ws auto</code> to <code>websockets-sansio</code>\nwhen websockets is installed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n<li>Skip the eager app import in the parent process with\n<code>--reload</code> or <code>--workers</code>, fixing a memory\nregression introduced in 0.47.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3012\">#3012</a>)</li>\n<li>Build a fresh <code>asgi</code> scope dict per request (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2977\">#2977</a>)</li>\n<li>Cache the <code>asgi</code> scope sub-dict per connection (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2976\">#2976</a>)</li>\n<li>Avoid copying single-frame WebSocket payloads in\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2983\">#2983</a>)</li>\n<li>Memoize trusted host checks in <code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2970\">#2970</a>)</li>\n<li>Replace <code>click.style</code> with an internal ANSI style helper\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2981\">#2981</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Deprecated</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Deprecate the legacy <code>websockets</code> implementation; use\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> or <code>wsproto</code> instead (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.49.0 (June 3, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump <code>httptools</code> minimum version to 0.8.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2962\">#2962</a>)</li>\n<li>Consume duplicate forwarding headers in\n<code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code> (reverses the 0.48.0 behavior of\nignoring them) (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2971\">#2971</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.48.0 (May 24, 2026)</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/e4d0b05eb8c6459b7ba27ad13a2c2f4f8d4ece50\"><code>e4d0b05</code></a>\nVersion 0.51.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3028\">#3028</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/944e43ddbf715aea7c587f2738cd94c3f9106110\"><code>944e43d</code></a>\nRemove colorama from the standard extra (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2e787704f2610133059e76d56bbd60f48edd34a3\"><code>2e78770</code></a>\nRestart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime reloads\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/a1b570cf577d512bfd396b64d72313233e9c3325\"><code>a1b570c</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3022\">#3022</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/83c7da7332ac3100171c258071de40d5dde35e13\"><code>83c7da7</code></a>\nRequire websockets&gt;=13.0 for the default sansio implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/b4d011668a75d02370353f34de6dea59692dcad2\"><code>b4d0116</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3020\">#3020</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2a9151d0e763df2c56da2bfe8c5dcead4fe5a276\"><code>2a9151d</code></a>\nSplit comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in the\nwebsockets-sansi...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/1bf3ab42e3aba1cf4acd1ef0c29d8ad9a599d333\"><code>1bf3ab4</code></a>\nCover the excluded-directory branch in <code>FileFilter</code> with a\ndirect test (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3014\">#3014</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/837b5f960dbe2f03e9f12feb9955ce2217211ad8\"><code>837b5f9</code></a>\nDeflake multiprocess, reload, and signal supervisor tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2975\">#2975</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/21d2c16fd162ce0e92b5c35f4aadca63a8b12e2d\"><code>21d2c16</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3013\">#3013</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.34.0...0.51.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-21T12:21:46Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/7b895977bfc06d2da10d9192d8763654967d3c70/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"c6a35d0a4c7ee09eb491108779e975a156b183e3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/c6a35d0a4c7ee09eb491108779e975a156b183e3","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/c6a35d0a4c7ee09eb491108779e975a156b183e3"}]},{"sha":"c6a35d0a4c7ee09eb491108779e975a156b183e3","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKGM2YTM1ZDBhNGM3ZWUwOWViNDkxMTA4Nzc5ZTk3NWExNTZiMTgzZTM","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-21T12:17:02Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T12:17:02Z"},"message":"deps(core-storage-api): update setuptools requirement from >=75 to >=83.0.0 in /core-storage-api (#602)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[setuptools](https://github.com/pypa/setuptools) to permit the latest\nversion.\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/blob/main/NEWS.rst\">setuptools's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h1>v83.0.0</h1>\n<h2>Features</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Require Python 3.10 or later.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Bugfixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>MANIFEST.in</code> matching (via <code>FileList</code>) is now\ninsensitive to Unicode\nnormalization form. A pattern authored in one form (e.g. NFC, as\ntypically\nsaved by editors) now matches a file whose name is stored on disk in\nanother\n(e.g. NFD, as produced by macOS APFS/HFS+). Previously an\n<code>exclude</code>,\n<code>global-exclude</code>, <code>recursive-exclude</code>, or\n<code>prune</code> rule could silently\nfail to drop a non-ASCII-named file from the source distribution,\npublishing\nit despite the exclusion -- see GHSA-h35f-9h28-mq5c.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Deprecations and Removals</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><code>pypa/distutils#334</code></li>\n</ul>\n<h1>v82.0.1</h1>\n<h2>Bugfixes</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the loading of <code>launcher manifest.xml</code> file. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5047\">#5047</a>)</li>\n<li>Replaced deprecated <code>json.__version__</code> with fixture in\ntests. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5186\">#5186</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Improved Documentation</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Add advice about how to improve predictability when installing\nsdists. (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5168\">#5168</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>Misc</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/4941\">#4941</a>,\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5157\">#5157</a>,\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5169\">#5169</a>,\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5175\">#5175</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>v82.0.0</p>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/6519f728c6f23c992df81a5691ef7655184a20eb\"><code>6519f72</code></a>\nBump version: 82.0.1 → 83.0.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/d1151b125b29a6ee1c7db860f7ee6c365d525b5f\"><code>d1151b1</code></a>\nMerge pull request <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5250\">#5250</a>\nfrom pypa/feature/distutils-d7633fbed</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/a2df31e6a741b0fe775969618fe6a3a3d032e900\"><code>a2df31e</code></a>\nCapture removal of dry_run parameter in changelog.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/00144dc3fb6d023fd81cdc26c380a012b084df9b\"><code>00144dc</code></a>\nMoved newsfragment to the release where it occurred.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/a4a5a2b160357be77626aa077ddd1d8ee53be50f\"><code>a4a5a2b</code></a>\nAdd news fragment.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/77470c23c35031c9e37d7512694ac5ca52bfcaac\"><code>77470c2</code></a>\nMerge <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/distutils\">https://github.com/pypa/distutils</a>\ninto feature/distutils-d7633fbed</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/3c43897420f25a1be1afe6eaa905d056009cc736\"><code>3c43897</code></a>\nMerge pull request <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/pypa/setuptools/issues/5247\">#5247</a>\nfrom pypa/copilot/fix-pypy-version-issue</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/bb6ea66b4bd01cb35d7c68a1bc61b96d59190269\"><code>bb6ea66</code></a>\nBump PyPy from 3.10 to 3.11 in CI workflow</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/a2bc3aca2f55eb9b93ea633e58ba68170ce14451\"><code>a2bc3ac</code></a>\nFix broken intersphinx reference to build's installation docs</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/commit/2d6a739c64cfedc65e1f635af7b52340aac8d99b\"><code>2d6a739</code></a>\nUse stacked parametrize decorators instead of itertools.product</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/pypa/setuptools/compare/v75.0.0...v83.0.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1bdeae0ebbe72e6a17fd70743775a9ea684d23c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/1bdeae0ebbe72e6a17fd70743775a9ea684d23c5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/com