rs/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3"}]},{"sha":"197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKDE5N2QyNWE5MzczNGVjNmU5NDJmOTUzYTFiYzFhMDg4MjEwMThiZjM","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-21T11:48:36Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T11:48:36Z"},"message":"deps(core-operations): update uvicorn[standard] requirement from <1,>=0.34 to >=0.51.0,<1 in /core-operations (#596)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[uvicorn[standard]](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn) to permit the\nlatest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Version 0.51.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime\nreloads by <a href=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025\">Kludex/uvicorn#3025</a></li>\n<li>Remove colorama from the standard extra by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027\">Kludex/uvicorn#3027</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0\">https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/blob/main/docs/release-notes.md\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>0.51.0 (July 8, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers one at a time on <code>SIGHUP</code>, bringing each\nreplacement up before retiring the old worker, so reloads no longer drop\nrequests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Removed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>colorama</code> from the <code>standard</code> extra\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.2 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require <code>websockets&gt;=13.0</code>, which the default\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation needs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.1 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Split comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in\nthe <code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3019\">#3019</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.0 (July 4, 2026)</h2>\n<p>If you use WebSockets, note that <code>--ws auto</code> now picks the\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation. You shouldn't need it,\nbut you can pin <code>--ws websockets</code> to get the deprecated\nlegacy one back.</p>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Exit with the dedicated code 3 on any startup failure: app loading,\nsocket bind and lifespan startup errors previously exited with a mix of\n0, 1 and 3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Stop the multiprocess supervisor when a worker exits with code 3\ninstead of restarting it forever (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Default <code>--ws auto</code> to <code>websockets-sansio</code>\nwhen websockets is installed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n<li>Skip the eager app import in the parent process with\n<code>--reload</code> or <code>--workers</code>, fixing a memory\nregression introduced in 0.47.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3012\">#3012</a>)</li>\n<li>Build a fresh <code>asgi</code> scope dict per request (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2977\">#2977</a>)</li>\n<li>Cache the <code>asgi</code> scope sub-dict per connection (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2976\">#2976</a>)</li>\n<li>Avoid copying single-frame WebSocket payloads in\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2983\">#2983</a>)</li>\n<li>Memoize trusted host checks in <code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2970\">#2970</a>)</li>\n<li>Replace <code>click.style</code> with an internal ANSI style helper\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2981\">#2981</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Deprecated</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Deprecate the legacy <code>websockets</code> implementation; use\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> or <code>wsproto</code> instead (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.49.0 (June 3, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump <code>httptools</code> minimum version to 0.8.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2962\">#2962</a>)</li>\n<li>Consume duplicate forwarding headers in\n<code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code> (reverses the 0.48.0 behavior of\nignoring them) (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2971\">#2971</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.48.0 (May 24, 2026)</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/e4d0b05eb8c6459b7ba27ad13a2c2f4f8d4ece50\"><code>e4d0b05</code></a>\nVersion 0.51.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3028\">#3028</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/944e43ddbf715aea7c587f2738cd94c3f9106110\"><code>944e43d</code></a>\nRemove colorama from the standard extra (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2e787704f2610133059e76d56bbd60f48edd34a3\"><code>2e78770</code></a>\nRestart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime reloads\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/a1b570cf577d512bfd396b64d72313233e9c3325\"><code>a1b570c</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3022\">#3022</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/83c7da7332ac3100171c258071de40d5dde35e13\"><code>83c7da7</code></a>\nRequire websockets&gt;=13.0 for the default sansio implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/b4d011668a75d02370353f34de6dea59692dcad2\"><code>b4d0116</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3020\">#3020</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2a9151d0e763df2c56da2bfe8c5dcead4fe5a276\"><code>2a9151d</code></a>\nSplit comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in the\nwebsockets-sansi...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/1bf3ab42e3aba1cf4acd1ef0c29d8ad9a599d333\"><code>1bf3ab4</code></a>\nCover the excluded-directory branch in <code>FileFilter</code> with a\ndirect test (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3014\">#3014</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/837b5f960dbe2f03e9f12feb9955ce2217211ad8\"><code>837b5f9</code></a>\nDeflake multiprocess, reload, and signal supervisor tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2975\">#2975</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/21d2c16fd162ce0e92b5c35f4aadca63a8b12e2d\"><code>21d2c16</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3013\">#3013</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.34.0...0.51.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"7b6efedae34b886d0f4372d7de2b30382968e0b3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/7b6efedae34b886d0f4372d7de2b30382968e0b3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX1yUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAtOIQAKNR5FAi13tG52/S2hQTAtUp\nAjyI6DGenXg8DRqY17J/RBNIBW8HYbiBG/b6BixJj9FFKaNkREUOH43hfmStoHUk\nqEksJhBtIIi/r1TDRz0aE8MS7Z5qJudbEvw7gQ/0uyIGEAY9Lgs3REvMInU/Wetj\nRWG2Crgke+nLlD4h5FvdJe2nl+TJdrxFBZRhdBOKKifoOpxLlNQ0gaODcCbksnwY\ns0cBlxQr970Wek8H8IS1i78P+4XQ+lCmywVLAHg+4DUWmQiDjkjtwJk7tC/TMg3s\nLLFHglaZBFnCE3+3ZUffbnLa1nvjFmvN3ogJaF14nHcFRIjMuNtGin6KBT3BWJUG\nC/gU5wFfKAKnDl7jW8vCv8OGvvuqIFDN/VItK8U5bMV8VMTiuTKEjmyZsznOfgcd\n2vdqhAT8sEJErkC/BjbbUzXrdDKivz22R/ArdWrGZqHJDUj3wev8DWcl/+5HgKHN\npDC0JMHJGyRvHXaoFUPeOpQQppH0MbwLEcY0jQdJgURRw5RaDLDaTV37TAn1j/BX\nIMSUti2axwILBYz+T0Rt0NYqtY0npsRYvf7cmS9wkiQGXjKcv7sheV+56rratGXT\nASzcaTn5T3TL7MGnBGDI9YpyUFiNRnNrXqQ6jjMZc6YLz9No1djRpt1JaBCEG124\nXVzyxJMi8jX4Qca/ys3P\n=IuW4\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 7b6efedae34b886d0f4372d7de2b30382968e0b3\nparent cc4d6be6c0a15e2a5a796a84796904be9896a360\nauthor dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com> 1784634516 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784634516 +0300\n\ndeps(core-operations): update uvicorn[standard] requirement from <1,>=0.34 to >=0.51.0,<1 in /core-operations (#596)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[uvicorn[standard]](https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn) to permit the\nlatest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/releases\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>Version 0.51.0</h2>\n<h2>What's Changed</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime\nreloads by <a href=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3025\">Kludex/uvicorn#3025</a></li>\n<li>Remove colorama from the standard extra by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex\"><code>@​Kludex</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/pull/3027\">Kludex/uvicorn#3027</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Full Changelog</strong>: <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0\">https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.50.2...0.51.0</a></p>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/blob/main/docs/release-notes.md\">uvicorn[standard]'s\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>0.51.0 (July 8, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Added</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Restart workers one at a time on <code>SIGHUP</code>, bringing each\nreplacement up before retiring the old worker, so reloads no longer drop\nrequests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Removed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Remove <code>colorama</code> from the <code>standard</code> extra\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.2 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Require <code>websockets&gt;=13.0</code>, which the default\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation needs (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.1 (July 6, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Fixed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Split comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in\nthe <code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3019\">#3019</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.50.0 (July 4, 2026)</h2>\n<p>If you use WebSockets, note that <code>--ws auto</code> now picks the\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> implementation. You shouldn't need it,\nbut you can pin <code>--ws websockets</code> to get the deprecated\nlegacy one back.</p>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Exit with the dedicated code 3 on any startup failure: app loading,\nsocket bind and lifespan startup errors previously exited with a mix of\n0, 1 and 3 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Stop the multiprocess supervisor when a worker exits with code 3\ninstead of restarting it forever (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3001\">#3001</a>)</li>\n<li>Default <code>--ws auto</code> to <code>websockets-sansio</code>\nwhen websockets is installed (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n<li>Skip the eager app import in the parent process with\n<code>--reload</code> or <code>--workers</code>, fixing a memory\nregression introduced in 0.47.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3012\">#3012</a>)</li>\n<li>Build a fresh <code>asgi</code> scope dict per request (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2977\">#2977</a>)</li>\n<li>Cache the <code>asgi</code> scope sub-dict per connection (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2976\">#2976</a>)</li>\n<li>Avoid copying single-frame WebSocket payloads in\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2983\">#2983</a>)</li>\n<li>Memoize trusted host checks in <code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code>\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2970\">#2970</a>)</li>\n<li>Replace <code>click.style</code> with an internal ANSI style helper\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2981\">#2981</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Deprecated</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Deprecate the legacy <code>websockets</code> implementation; use\n<code>websockets-sansio</code> or <code>wsproto</code> instead (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2985\">#2985</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.49.0 (June 3, 2026)</h2>\n<h3>Changed</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Bump <code>httptools</code> minimum version to 0.8.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2962\">#2962</a>)</li>\n<li>Consume duplicate forwarding headers in\n<code>ProxyHeadersMiddleware</code> (reverses the 0.48.0 behavior of\nignoring them) (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2971\">#2971</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2>0.48.0 (May 24, 2026)</h2>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/e4d0b05eb8c6459b7ba27ad13a2c2f4f8d4ece50\"><code>e4d0b05</code></a>\nVersion 0.51.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3028\">#3028</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/944e43ddbf715aea7c587f2738cd94c3f9106110\"><code>944e43d</code></a>\nRemove colorama from the standard extra (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3027\">#3027</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2e787704f2610133059e76d56bbd60f48edd34a3\"><code>2e78770</code></a>\nRestart workers with overlap on SIGHUP for near-zero-downtime reloads\n(<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3025\">#3025</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/a1b570cf577d512bfd396b64d72313233e9c3325\"><code>a1b570c</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.2 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3022\">#3022</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/83c7da7332ac3100171c258071de40d5dde35e13\"><code>83c7da7</code></a>\nRequire websockets&gt;=13.0 for the default sansio implementation (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3021\">#3021</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/b4d011668a75d02370353f34de6dea59692dcad2\"><code>b4d0116</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3020\">#3020</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/2a9151d0e763df2c56da2bfe8c5dcead4fe5a276\"><code>2a9151d</code></a>\nSplit comma-separated <code>Sec-WebSocket-Protocol</code> values in the\nwebsockets-sansi...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/1bf3ab42e3aba1cf4acd1ef0c29d8ad9a599d333\"><code>1bf3ab4</code></a>\nCover the excluded-directory branch in <code>FileFilter</code> with a\ndirect test (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3014\">#3014</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/837b5f960dbe2f03e9f12feb9955ce2217211ad8\"><code>837b5f9</code></a>\nDeflake multiprocess, reload, and signal supervisor tests (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/2975\">#2975</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/commit/21d2c16fd162ce0e92b5c35f4aadca63a8b12e2d\"><code>21d2c16</code></a>\nVersion 0.50.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/issues/3013\">#3013</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/Kludex/uvicorn/compare/0.34.0...0.51.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-21T11:48:37Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/197d25a93734ec6e942f953a1bc1a08821018bf3/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"cc4d6be6c0a15e2a5a796a84796904be9896a360","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/cc4d6be6c0a15e2a5a796a84796904be9896a360","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/cc4d6be6c0a15e2a5a796a84796904be9896a360"}]},{"sha":"cc4d6be6c0a15e2a5a796a84796904be9896a360","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKGNjNGQ2YmU2YzBhMTVlMmE1YTc5NmE4NDc5NjkwNGJlOTg5NmEzNjA","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-21T11:43:42Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T11:43:42Z"},"message":"deps: update sentry-sdk requirement from <3,>=2.0 to >=2.66.0,<3 (#594)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[sentry-sdk](https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python) to permit the\nlatest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/releases\">sentry-sdk's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.66.0</h2>\n<h3>New Features ✨</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>(tracing) Promote trace_lifecycle and ignore_spans to top-level\noptions by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ericapisani\"><code>@​ericapisani</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6821\">#6821</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes 🐛</h3>\n<h4>Tracing</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(HTTP clients) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6811\">#6811</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(task queues) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6814\">#6814</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(misc) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6815\">#6815</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(databases) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6808\">#6808</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span (web\nframeworks) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6810\">#6810</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(django) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6809\">#6809</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Internal Changes 🔧</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>(logging) Fix flaky test_logging_captured_warnings by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ericapisani\"><code>@​ericapisani</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6824\">#6824</a></li>\n<li>Remove flaky no cyclic garbage test by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6817\">#6817</a></li>\n<li>Remove Claude permission settings by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cleptric\"><code>@​cleptric</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6806\">#6806</a></li>\n<li>Move <code>nullcontext</code> to <code>sentry_sdk.utils</code> by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6805\">#6805</a></li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/blob/master/CHANGELOG.md\">sentry-sdk's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>2.66.0</h2>\n<h3>New Features ✨</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>(tracing) Promote trace_lifecycle and ignore_spans to top-level\noptions by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ericapisani\"><code>@​ericapisani</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6821\">#6821</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes 🐛</h3>\n<h4>Tracing</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(HTTP clients) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6811\">#6811</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(task queues) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6814\">#6814</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(misc) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6815\">#6815</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(databases) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6808\">#6808</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span (web\nframeworks) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6810\">#6810</a></li>\n<li>Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current span\n(django) by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6809\">#6809</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Internal Changes 🔧</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>(logging) Fix flaky test_logging_captured_warnings by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ericapisani\"><code>@​ericapisani</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6824\">#6824</a></li>\n<li>Remove flaky no cyclic garbage test by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6817\">#6817</a></li>\n<li>Remove Claude permission settings by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/cleptric\"><code>@​cleptric</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6806\">#6806</a></li>\n<li>Move <code>nullcontext</code> to <code>sentry_sdk.utils</code> by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sentrivana\"><code>@​sentrivana</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6805\">#6805</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>2.65.0</h2>\n<h3>New Features ✨</h3>\n<h4>Huey</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Set <code>messaging.destination.name</code> on consumer spans by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6779\">#6779</a></li>\n<li>Set <code>messaging.destination.name</code> on producer spans by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6778\">#6778</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Other</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>(arq) Set <code>messaging.destination.name</code> on consumer spans\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6767\">#6767</a></li>\n<li>(dramatiq) Set <code>messaging.destination.name</code> on consumer\nspans by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6776\">#6776</a></li>\n<li>(rq) Set <code>messaging.destination.name</code> on consumer spans\nby <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/alexander-alderman-webb\"><code>@​alexander-alderman-webb</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6774\">#6774</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes 🐛</h3>\n<h4>Tracing</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>Take first sentry-trace header in case multiple are supplied by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/sl0thentr0py\"><code>@​sl0thentr0py</code></a>\nin <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6722\">#6722</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h4>Other</h4>\n<ul>\n<li>(django) Avoid <code>ValueError</code> in async middleware\n<code>process_*</code> hooks by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/r0ro\"><code>@​r0ro</code></a> in <a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6698\">#6698</a></li>\n<li>(scope) Drop None user attribute values in set_user by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ericapisani\"><code>@​ericapisani</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6692\">#6692</a></li>\n<li>(starlette) Don't overwrite user set during request in\nAuthenticationMiddleware by <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/ericapisani\"><code>@​ericapisani</code></a> in\n<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/pull/6760\">#6760</a></li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/5179f60b025693f381d6d93cd69817f32931825b\"><code>5179f60</code></a>\nupdate changelog with docs link</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/e4bcb59e5a87772b1a9dee6189889a2dcee8d776\"><code>e4bcb59</code></a>\nrelease: 2.66.0</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/5ba869c03908edde69b2c6526bdd5f03a37bfef4\"><code>5ba869c</code></a>\nfix(tracing): Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current\nspan...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/efddaab9211769982e0c1874e2fb77b0db88b4cd\"><code>efddaab</code></a>\nfix(tracing): Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current\nspan...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/b199a9eea34d7107d81714ca2d1c759f3a6e7e0e\"><code>b199a9e</code></a>\nfix(tracing): Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current\nspan...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/d695a6eb6ab6a81251d1abec12b61456b786a566\"><code>d695a6e</code></a>\nfix(tracing): Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current\nspan...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/dbf5d03f30d97cffd12116e09a34df7b4c2fdafe\"><code>dbf5d03</code></a>\nfix(tracing): Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current\nspan...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/5c1403440a25999f7d6ce69fcb106205be0b8322\"><code>5c14034</code></a>\nfix(tracing): Skip child span creation in streaming path when no current\nspan...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/e0d2c4a4c5e01452865d06d4cdcafb5823fef164\"><code>e0d2c4a</code></a>\nfeat(tracing): Promote trace_lifecycle and ignore_spans to top-level\noptions ...</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/commit/baa423fa766a5ba990ad27b1d3b1231f4b265182\"><code>baa423f</code></a>\ntest(logging): Fix flaky test_logging_captured_warnings (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/issues/6824\">#6824</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/getsentry/sentry-python/compare/2.0.0...2.66.0\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"6993ada3644a691659b46e20be45770c00363b91","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/6993ada3644a691659b46e20be45770c00363b91"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/cc4d6be6c0a15e2a5a796a84796904be9896a360","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","sign