:"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"e27404832de97900d0db4ed9d3cdb830f0c1777e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/e27404832de97900d0db4ed9d3cdb830f0c1777e","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/e27404832de97900d0db4ed9d3cdb830f0c1777e"}]},{"sha":"e27404832de97900d0db4ed9d3cdb830f0c1777e","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKGUyNzQwNDgzMmRlOTc5MDBkMGRiNGVkOWQzY2RiODMwZjBjMTc3N2U","commit":{"author":{"name":"dependabot[bot]","email":"49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com","date":"2026-07-21T11:03:30Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T11:03:30Z"},"message":"deps: update google-genai requirement from >=0.3 to >=2.12.1 (#590)\n\nUpdates the requirements on\n[google-genai](https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai) to permit the\nlatest version.\n<details>\n<summary>Release notes</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/releases\">google-genai's\nreleases</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2>v2.12.1</h2>\n<h2><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.12.0...v2.12.1\">2.12.1</a>\n(2026-07-16)</h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the normalization of Interactions inside triggers (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/be554d3f35dd4e74c49769379c82225d8b5c3032\">be554d3</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Changelog</summary>\n<p><em>Sourced from <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md\">google-genai's\nchangelog</a>.</em></p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.12.0...v2.12.1\">2.12.1</a>\n(2026-07-16)</h2>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Fix the normalization of Interactions inside triggers (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/be554d3f35dd4e74c49769379c82225d8b5c3032\">be554d3</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.11.0...v2.12.0\">2.12.0</a>\n(2026-07-15)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add AntigravityAgentConfig to OpenAPI schema overlays and regenerate\nSDKs. (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/c68f857234ed510ed3d85b136cca8a5b7421e597\">c68f857</a>)</li>\n<li>Add trigger resource (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/0ab9525157aa04fbed46caa0955486c2a3aad11a\">0ab9525</a>)</li>\n<li>Add Triggers resource to GoogleGenAI client. (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/60727fe1277c68fe7c4da3be7e369408b5463e7f\">60727fe</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>interactions:</strong> Add CodeMenderAgentConfig (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/50eca746eb6acf66e98e6381b71c122a868613f0\">50eca74</a>)</li>\n<li>Populate per-modality prompt token count in embedding responses for\ngemini-embedding-2 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/2ba0154a41654dc2e999c6242633e2b2eedaa5e7\">2ba0154</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.10.0...v2.11.0\">2.11.0</a>\n(2026-07-09)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add environment_id in network config (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/df5f13a9decc1f01f102aba1b953f2a4c6e350d6\">df5f13a</a>)</li>\n<li>Add response_format and Translation_config in GenerationConfig (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/8928da369dfad9eb77979a207b435d4ab589eca0\">8928da3</a>)</li>\n<li>Add retrieval result step and new fields to maps and search results\n(<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/d2b19f6d1a8659af56515f537dc148fb25b5422c\">d2b19f6</a>)</li>\n<li>Add Tool.exa_ai_search for Gemini Enterprise API (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/8928da369dfad9eb77979a207b435d4ab589eca0\">8928da3</a>)</li>\n<li>Support Function declarations during Agent Creation (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/bbeb934283e64ec2232576ea8fbd30ff96e589bb\">bbeb934</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Bug Fixes</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Avoid shadowing of built-in list in Python 3.14 (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/5a140468953aa73eee66c879225281db0a92dede\">5a14046</a>)</li>\n<li>Event loop mismatch in GenAI SDK (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/10df4b1eeb54140ca56e011d3bc21862f6d594d0\">10df4b1</a>)</li>\n<li><strong>interactions:</strong> Accept both dict and list[dict] for\ntransform (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/8c7cee3405fa3a6f23dccf44b0bb120eeb546ae6\">8c7cee3</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Documentation</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Agent Platform MCP example to readme (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/cb2a2a3a7aba32b01569ac9a1b61652e18d2728c\">cb2a2a3</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h3>Code Refactoring</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>interactions:</strong> Remove cached_content,\npresence_penalty, and frequency_penalty; expose safety_settings and\nlabels (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/ba552f72b657a4b5893d453a500b42dfe8d659e4\">ba552f7</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v2.9.0...v2.10.0\">2.10.0</a>\n(2026-06-24)</h2>\n<h3>Features</h3>\n<ul>\n<li>Add Agent Platform MCP support to async generate_content_stream (<a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/a4772cce433632fbf49eb029bf601480ef58a2ab\">a4772cc</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<!-- raw HTML omitted -->\n</blockquote>\n<p>... (truncated)</p>\n</details>\n<details>\n<summary>Commits</summary>\n<ul>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/6debc1c88d6b1e0f60faf01ecc2868760a81af00\"><code>6debc1c</code></a>\nchore(main): release 2.12.1 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/python-genai/issues/2734\">#2734</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/94d59e5ae462f49c88256ed122fa7dd9712337f0\"><code>94d59e5</code></a>\nCopybara import of the project:</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/be554d3f35dd4e74c49769379c82225d8b5c3032\"><code>be554d3</code></a>\nfix: fix the normalization of Interactions inside triggers</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/939c667fa96a63d44c83e813114bb00faa1a609d\"><code>939c667</code></a>\nchore(main): release 2.12.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/googleapis/python-genai/issues/2696\">#2696</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/8115b163cdb5a96bfa48f7c3f170a17af88e1129\"><code>8115b16</code></a>\nchore: internal change</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/c8750696763056122433b4b611c84063c575396a\"><code>c875069</code></a>\nfeat: Add max_total_tokens for Interaction.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/d38eaca21d244dce66e4261806b20be804824bb1\"><code>d38eaca</code></a>\nchore: defer <code>mcp</code> SDK import to first MCP usage</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/2a9350d1f3f38e13738ab1527357810aef9cea45\"><code>2a9350d</code></a>\ntest: add tests for private chat</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/c68f857234ed510ed3d85b136cca8a5b7421e597\"><code>c68f857</code></a>\nfeat: Add AntigravityAgentConfig to OpenAPI schema overlays and\nregenerate SDKs.</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/commit/60727fe1277c68fe7c4da3be7e369408b5463e7f\"><code>60727fe</code></a>\nfeat: Add Triggers resource to GoogleGenAI client.</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/googleapis/python-genai/compare/v0.3.0...v2.12.1\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\n\nDependabot will resolve any conflicts with this PR as long as you don't\nalter it yourself. You can also trigger a rebase manually by commenting\n`@dependabot rebase`.\n\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-start)\n[//]: # (dependabot-automerge-end)\n\n---\n\n<details>\n<summary>Dependabot commands and options</summary>\n<br />\n\nYou can trigger Dependabot actions by commenting on this PR:\n- `@dependabot rebase` will rebase this PR\n- `@dependabot recreate` will recreate this PR, overwriting any edits\nthat have been made to it\n- `@dependabot show <dependency name> ignore conditions` will show all\nof the ignore conditions of the specified dependency\n- `@dependabot ignore this major version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this major version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this minor version` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this minor version (unless you reopen\nthe PR or upgrade to it yourself)\n- `@dependabot ignore this dependency` will close this PR and stop\nDependabot creating any more for this dependency (unless you reopen the\nPR or upgrade to it yourself)\n\n\n</details>\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"05f2a064aafd0d0539528d1626b53a1c04e516fb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura