t/commit/631c942040754b6e095e929c1677c07e10ed4f87\"><code>631c942</code></a>\neslint 9 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/issues/2474\">#2474</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/actions/checkout/commit/4f1f4aec02e41874fa0262ea8ff5172d7978ad1e\"><code>4f1f4ae</code></a>\nBump actions/upload-artifact from 4 to 7 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/issues/2476\">#2476</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/actions/checkout/commit/ba097532fb203f7e88c9c3c0b899b49469908a92\"><code>ba09753</code></a>\nBump actions/checkout from 6 to 7 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/issues/2488\">#2488</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/actions/checkout/commit/b9e0990d219a03df7633c93f6f005a8fecbcab22\"><code>b9e0990</code></a>\nBump docker/login-action from 3.3.0 to 4.2.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/issues/2479\">#2479</a>)</li>\n<li><a\nhref=\"https://github.com/actions/checkout/commit/e8cb398be4a550817e382abf69e4c12c76fce1f2\"><code>e8cb398</code></a>\nBump docker/build-push-action from 6.5.0 to 7.2.0 (<a\nhref=\"https://redirect.github.com/actions/checkout/issues/2478\">#2478</a>)</li>\n<li>Additional commits viewable in <a\nhref=\"https://github.com/actions/checkout/compare/v4...v7\">compare\nview</a></li>\n</ul>\n</details>\n<br />\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-21T10:53:54Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/63cb8248f7662f431bf0a3ff2515c8c211e96c0d","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/63cb8248f7662f431bf0a3ff2515c8c211e96c0d","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/63cb8248f7662f431bf0a3ff2515c8c211e96c0d/comments","author":{"login":"dependabot[bot]","id":49699333,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDk2OTkzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/in/29110?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D","html_url":"https://github.com/apps/dependabot","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/dependabot%5Bbot%5D/received_events","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647"}]},{"sha":"081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKDA4MTU1MWU5MTg0NjIyMWIwYmEzNTgyZjNlZjI1NWE1YjFlMjU2NDc","commit":{"author":{"name":"Eldad Dahan","email":"eldad@caura.ai","date":"2026-07-21T10:48:12Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T10:48:12Z"},"message":"deps(plugin): upgrade TypeScript to 7 (supersedes #547) (#611)\n\n## What\nUpgrades the plugin to **TypeScript 7** — bumps `typescript` to `^7.0`\nand adds `\"types\": [\"node\"]` to `plugin/tsconfig.json`.\n\n## Why this replaces Dependabot #547\nMerging #547 (the raw `typescript` 5→7 bump) **would break `main`**: TS7\nchanged the default `@types` auto-inclusion, so `tsc` stops seeing Node\nglobals (`fs`, `process`, `crypto`, `node:test`…) — ~47 `TS2591` errors\n— until the tsconfig explicitly lists `\"types\": [\"node\"]`. #547's green\ncheckmark was misleading because the plugin isn't type-checked in CI\n(fixed by #610).\n\n## Verification\nBuilt locally against the #546-merged `main` (`@types/node` already at\n26.1.1): `npm ci && npm run build` (`tsc`) → **exit 0, clean**. Lockfile\nregenerated; #610's new plugin build step will re-verify on Linux in CI.\n\nCloses #547.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nSigned-off-by: eldad-caura <eldad@caura.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a9f932d1aa5be6e703cf2fe276b2ae1753b0dccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/a9f932d1aa5be6e703cf2fe276b2ae1753b0dccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX05sCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWbcQAK5dZpwg7yhpcIJeHPM1xPbT\n/bo9qdPFe8f+KuOOuuzjsGBgf04PvPk9ecPxBcc3NUZwJ2DsDoHxhM/ZkdesN6TZ\nA0w8Cbh+teevEDdjoSQtXEP5u9mUEfP75GESSxQisyo1Ko4njgMssRD5lcFwFe+9\nErvo0FzWDcv3cQ3XhQwzG4M48VenIaauCe4uKDOqAxijF/ikn7sapAF7AyUSwh9B\nIvoSkpEdz7GQK6jqNKHP/lCqHVoFlhC2ik8P7p5gj/+ln0TR0alWIlwoKw6l++lk\nVYz06g1IEMVvloJsi4odVLs9maFuI5liNxE6NitvvKkvRD6MJ2YDAVxXbPR/0y1m\nGSUzuW2XmvjLWmJdfx+54lriyNNNkxyRv3WgEC3bYFXJ2oI3qbztXwM8TMKEIrqa\nOjqEsT9hLT1TfpFaQrZB6WbafXofqd3vFEEkx2q/YzNxo1CQc/dHl5IhZqa2jU6u\nQs7v0239v74nPINN5cynK4Vi2RW7yWKRYsZfP184XnfgmU+LSjlHiIKO0bjI1Cr7\nbeEPRJtYVjEr4c6mamSrIP7acSZpvjlJ0wwx3N0EwvWwHfky59430dYYyZAyo6Rx\n76Sp6glFXQDkHGbTFMpJeecEybWYDZseFy97GyrMvPBxLp12r7WuKc9BUnNHAEhz\nFNdOLBmtI+RiBzp0OGiZ\n=SGPx\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree a9f932d1aa5be6e703cf2fe276b2ae1753b0dccd\nparent aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12\nauthor Eldad Dahan <eldad@caura.ai> 1784630892 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784630892 +0300\n\ndeps(plugin): upgrade TypeScript to 7 (supersedes #547) (#611)\n\n## What\nUpgrades the plugin to **TypeScript 7** — bumps `typescript` to `^7.0`\nand adds `\"types\": [\"node\"]` to `plugin/tsconfig.json`.\n\n## Why this replaces Dependabot #547\nMerging #547 (the raw `typescript` 5→7 bump) **would break `main`**: TS7\nchanged the default `@types` auto-inclusion, so `tsc` stops seeing Node\nglobals (`fs`, `process`, `crypto`, `node:test`…) — ~47 `TS2591` errors\n— until the tsconfig explicitly lists `\"types\": [\"node\"]`. #547's green\ncheckmark was misleading because the plugin isn't type-checked in CI\n(fixed by #610).\n\n## Verification\nBuilt locally against the #546-merged `main` (`@types/node` already at\n26.1.1): `npm ci && npm run build` (`tsc`) → **exit 0, clean**. Lockfile\nregenerated; #610's new plugin build step will re-verify on Linux in CI.\n\nCloses #547.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nSigned-off-by: eldad-caura <eldad@caura.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-21T10:48:13Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/081551e91846221b0ba3582f3ef255a5b1e25647/comments","author":{"login":"Eldad-Caura","id":250841599,"node_id":"U_kgDODvOJ_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250841599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura","html_url":"https://github.com/Eldad-Caura","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"parents":[{"sha":"aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12"}]},{"sha":"aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12","node_id":"C_kwDOSOAAX9oAKGFhMGNmMjNiZDI4YTEwNGRhYjk3ODljZjM4ZDcyMDkyNjIwODdiMTI","commit":{"author":{"name":"Eldad Dahan","email":"eldad@caura.ai","date":"2026-07-21T10:25:31Z"},"committer":{"name":"GitHub","email":"noreply@github.com","date":"2026-07-21T10:25:31Z"},"message":"ci: type-check + build the plugin in CI (#610)\n\n## What\nAdds a `cd plugin && npm ci && npm run build` (tsc) step to the CI job.\n\n## Why\nThe plugin currently has **no type-check gate in CI**:\n- The only plugin step is `npm run check:version` (version-sync — runs\nno compiler).\n- The real TS `Build + test` job lives in `client-typescript-ci.yml`,\nwhich is **path-scoped to the client SDK, not `/plugin`**.\n\nSo a `/plugin`-only PR can be fully green while `tsc` would fail. This\nsurfaced when Dependabot's **typescript 5→7** bump (#547) would have\nbroken `main` with ~47 `TS2591` errors despite a green checkmark. This\nstep closes that blind spot (and runs `npm ci` on Linux, giving us\nlockfile validation too).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nSigned-off-by: eldad-caura <eldad@caura.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4b886e81988eba8f127c31914f8c212a2909fd53","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/trees/4b886e81988eba8f127c31914f8c212a2909fd53"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/git/commits/aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12","comment_count":0,"verification":{"verified":true,"reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqX0kbCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAANHUQAISpzeJPbs62koP+tBsZU+//\nBE4sGQoDQMiInsYPZihEBO9KqQ2gamqlMpfRTP1QYlFHUZHdorgj2Z089ab7tV7a\nE4d+Mk9drOhC8GTFfiWKSEbxO0ydAFEL7abGuDQS9bysAbXRAUyvSjYND3xblGvX\ns7SLg7dZitF0940KMp6tbXE3R506b6o2RBUP47uPieViLXHlFZFtNPoJldkwpnJN\ncf5WB1vA5haLM4AnLzWwqx6Gbn7NFo4P1yOlFSyCcR5SGSxb60Vqx0M9/KGCZgPO\nkRboNBvCiryVBHf9WHkMWfTLh2JFl9w+GNO4jL9cgEsnWxJQ4zWeBKZhhf5LLras\nlEemdIMdr7pBMGJpkxp5ZRT2SNyEnbLLu0hunItBGewZ0YeAwYYbon84T/C5PSOv\n5bd8HGhLeqyos21nkslXkmP0x6p+ZpLVewTwH/t7cj59I5kjgji3r5Cu9/1p7p8d\nDenmIiwktIkC3q3A6FGNKs/3kwrk1+QO5i2HTuv9jlEc/k1EUuYm61KFd9k46bGd\nvOEQqX0NyFJC2ZdkApkhkEK48qOJB9mFl2+fK41voeaJinn3oTlphshF9KQk9e+U\nEB5JnhNoiiJRwhFB1z2d3j2HDAUcEzMqEkkBI20rA9ExwMoMjA5uY+Y8nTxqZ/+5\nWbQN3E7bweBkVqm60YzB\n=1XBw\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","payload":"tree 4b886e81988eba8f127c31914f8c212a2909fd53\nparent caa26595153ffb24e2cadcfeca7572c0d45bb1e3\nauthor Eldad Dahan <eldad@caura.ai> 1784629531 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1784629531 +0300\n\nci: type-check + build the plugin in CI (#610)\n\n## What\nAdds a `cd plugin && npm ci && npm run build` (tsc) step to the CI job.\n\n## Why\nThe plugin currently has **no type-check gate in CI**:\n- The only plugin step is `npm run check:version` (version-sync — runs\nno compiler).\n- The real TS `Build + test` job lives in `client-typescript-ci.yml`,\nwhich is **path-scoped to the client SDK, not `/plugin`**.\n\nSo a `/plugin`-only PR can be fully green while `tsc` would fail. This\nsurfaced when Dependabot's **typescript 5→7** bump (#547) would have\nbroken `main` with ~47 `TS2591` errors despite a green checkmark. This\nstep closes that blind spot (and runs `npm ci` on Linux, giving us\nlockfile validation too).\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.com/claude-code)\n\nSigned-off-by: eldad-caura <eldad@caura.ai>\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","verified_at":"2026-07-21T10:25:32Z"}},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12","html_url":"https://github.com/caura-ai/caura/commit/aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/caura-ai/caura/commits/aa0cf23bd28a104dab9789cf38d7209262087b12/comments","author":{"login":"Eldad-Caura","id":250841599,"node_id":"U_kgDODvOJ_w","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/250841599?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura","html_url":"https://github.com/Eldad-Caura","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Eldad-Caura/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"committer":{"login":"web-flow","id":19864447,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","rep